<title>USA: Cooper to redeem debentures, sees cash flow.</title>
<headline>Cooper to redeem debentures, sees cash flow.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Industries Inc said Wednesday it called for a $190 million redemption of its 7.05 percent convertible subordinated debentures due 2015.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that the action will result in &quot;positive cash flow and a modest earnings improvement.&quot;</p>
<p>Cooper said the called debentures will be redeemed on February 21, 1997.</p>
<p>Cooper has $690 million of 7.05 percent debentures outstanding.</p>
</text>
